    "section_rich_text_NppmXj": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_yqgQVi": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Welcome to the FlavCity Community",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "text_yEBDxT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you’re one of our more than 18 million followers, you already know that we’ve been on a mission since 2012 to help you thrive by knowing exactly what you put into your body.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_B39E4J": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’re obsessed with using real, whole ingredients in our products, and avoiding weird, artificial ingredients that no one can pronounce. We’re talking ingredients you can feel great about.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_eAejPK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our FlavCity community is our biggest inspiration, and that’s why we’ve built a brand that not only makes ridiculously clean protein smoothies and functional drinks, but also helps you navigate the grocery store like a clean-eating pro. </p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_q3ewk7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>First we disrupted the protein powder category with our All In One smoothie, and we didn’t stop there. Our goal is to make clean eating easy, delicious, accessible, and dare we say, <em><strong>cool!</strong></em></p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text_wzMTcn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We want to be your trusted source for all things clean nutrition. So, whether you’re sipping one of our <a href=\"/collections/protein-smoothies\" title=\"Protein Smoothies\">smoothies</a>, <a href=\"/collections/electrolytes\" title=\"Electrolytes\">electrolytes</a> or <a href=\"/collections/immunity\" title=\"Immune Support\">teas</a> or just hanging with Bobby on his <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/flavcity/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/flavcity/?hl=en\">Instagram feed</a>, we’re here to help you fuel your body right.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-large",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
