            "padding_bottom": 24,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "text_U4HFMA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We strive to provide you with the best possible products; and are deeply committed to using the cleanest ingredients that meet yours and our quality standards. We rigorously and continually utilize a third party to lab-test ingredients for heavy metals, forever chemicals, fluoride, and more. Our dedication to whole-food accessibility is unwavering, and the integrity of our product-development standards is a core value on which you can always rely. Everything from FlavCity is always Bobby Approved!</p>",
